Coverage and exception channels through LIMIT=300
-------------------------------------------------
  Goldbach misses among even 4..300: []
  Lemoine misses among odd 7..300: []
  Odd-prime-compatible Lemoine misses: [7]
  q=2-only odd exceptions: [7]
The q=2 channel is the exceptional even-prime seam: it proves small
Lemoine rows but has no same odd-prime Goldbach pair E=p+q.

Same-pair bipartite degrees, using odd-prime pairs only:
  edges=1243
  top even degrees: [(120, 24), (150, 24), (144, 22), (114, 20), (126, 20), (156, 20), (168, 20), (180, 19)]
  top odd degrees : [(285, 25), (225, 21), (273, 21), (297, 20), (237, 18), (255, 18), (291, 18), (231, 17)]

